            "autoplay_speed": 5,
            "display_arrows": false,
            "display_dots": false,
            "author_1": "<strong>Мария Т., България</strong> [stars]",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/smiling-middle-aged-woman.jpg",
            "text_1": "<p>\"В периода на перименопауза съм. Приемам Шиладжит гумените бонбони вече 3 седмици и УАУ, чувствам се прекрасно! Вече няма нощно изпотяване, не хапвам толкова между храненията, ставите са по-гъвкави и се събуждам отпочинала и пълна с енергия. Най-хубавото? Панталоните ми са по-свободни и топовете седят по-добре!\"</p>",
            "author_2": "<strong>Donna S., България</strong> [stars]",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/GettyImages-1072792764.jpg",
            "text_2": "<p>\"Не съм спала толкова добре от години. След няколко дни приемане на Wellness Nest Шиладжит гумените бонбони забелязах, че съм по-спокойна, по-съсредоточена и много по-малко подута. Енергията ми е на максимум. Горещо препоръчвам на всички жени в менопауза – ще ви промени живота!\"</p>",
            "author_3": "<strong>Kimberly L., България</strong> [stars]",
            "image_3": "shopify://shop_images/download.webp",
            "text_3": "<p>\"В началото бях скептична, защото нищо не помагаше за моя „менопаузен корем\". Но Шиладжит гумените бонбони наистина работят. Коремът ми е забележимо по-плосък, чувствам се по-лека и дори се радвам да се огледам в огледалото.\"</p>",
            "margin_top": 9,
            "margin_bottom": 9
          }
        },
        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Say Goodbye to Menopause Stress",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Waving Hand",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": true,
            "content": "<p>If you relate to any of these, MenoMate is the solution you've been waiting for:</p><ul><li><strong>Stubborn weight gain</strong> that won't budge despite your efforts</li><li><strong>Aching joints</strong> that make you feel older than your years</li><li><strong>Hot flashes & night sweats</strong> that disrupt your day and steal your sleep</li><li><strong>Mood swings</strong> that leave you feeling like a stranger to yourself</li></ul><p>Finally, a natural solution that targets the root cause of these frustrating symptoms—not just the surface problems.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ewadFh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Relief Where It Matters",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Local Hospital",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Targets hot flashes, night sweats, and sleeplessness so you can focus on what really matters.</p><p>🤸 <strong>Emotional Balance</strong>: DIM and MenoMate Probiotic Blend help keep mood swings at bay.</p><p>🧘🏻‍♂️ <strong>Calm & Composed</strong>: Minimizes stress levels so you can feel more at peace.</p><p>🧪 <strong>Hormone-Free Formula</strong>: Works gently with your body, without introducing external hormones.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_7nK4Qk": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Recommended Usage",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Recommend",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<ul><li>Take <strong>2 capsules a day</strong>, preferably at the same time each day for consistent support.</li><li>Give your body at least <strong>2-3 months</strong> to fully adjust, though many users notice improvements sooner.</li><li><strong>Hydration & Light Exercise</strong> amplify the benefits, helping you see faster, longer-lasting results.</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_r6wNxc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "MenoMate Ingredient Facts",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "Fact Check",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>Serving Size: </strong>2 capsules per serving (30 servings per container). </p><ul><li>Turmeric Root Extract (Curcuma longa L.) 350mg; </li><li>Inulin (Fructoligosaccharides) (from Chicory root) 337.5mg; </li><li>MenoMate Probiotic Blend 10B CFU: Bifidobacterium animalis subsp. Lactis, Bifidobacterium breve, Lactobacillus gasseri; </li><li>Curry Leaf Extract (Helichrysum italicum) 50mg; </li><li>Black Cohosh Powder Extract (Cimicifuga racemosa) (stem, root) 40mg; </li><li>DI-Indolylmethane (DIM) 40mg; </li><li>Moringa Leaf Extract (Moringa oleifera) 35mg; </li><li>Bioperine® Organic Black Pepper Extract (Piper nigrum) 3mg</li></ul>",
